# Promotion holds for the project repository (builder/rings.sh).
#
# One hold per line: <kernel|*> <level|*> <reason>
# A held level stays in its ring: it is not promoted canary -> early ->
# stable. "* * <reason>" stops all promotions. Add a hold by pull request
# when a level misbehaves on canary nodes; revoke it (builder/revoke.sh) if
# nodes must stop running it.
#
# Example:
# 7.0.14-30-pve 2 high load average after the transition on one canary node
